  "titleEn": "Global game platforms — bookmarks | aogl.cn",
  "titleZh": "全球游戏平台前十｜aogl.cn",
  "descEn": "Ten storefronts and publishers ordered like Newzoo / industry revenue league tables.",
  "descZh": "按 Newzoo 与行业营收常见梯队排序的十个商店与发行商，每站三条官方公告或博文外链。",
  "h1En": "Global storefront & publisher top 10",
  "h1Zh": "全球游戏平台前十（营收 / 装机口径）",
  "updated": "2026-06-01",
  "editorialHtmlEn": "<p>Steam and the three console families lead PC / living-room spend; Tencent-level mobile giants sit in “more” because their web hubs differ.</p><p>Hot mix below merges public RSS when you run <code>npm run fetch-hub-news</code> — dedupe is best-effort, timestamps come from feeds, and headlines often stay English at the source.</p><p>Last reviewed: <strong>2026-05-19</strong>. Piracy indexes, keygens, and unofficial ROM hosts are never listed.</p><p><strong>Who this page is for:</strong> readers who already follow a few storefront blogs but want one scrollable strip of <em>first-party</em> headlines (patches, hardware, live-service notes) without opening five tabs. I use it as a Sunday catch-up rail, not a discovery feed for unknown APK sites. If a publisher ships a major client update, I expect to see it via Steam News or the console blogs first — mobile-only MMO portals stay in “more” so the top ten stays comparable to Western revenue tables.</p>",
  "editorialHtmlZh": "<p>PC 与客厅支出仍是 Steam 加御三家打头；腾讯系手游体量也很大，但主站形态不同，放在「更多」里。</p><p>下方 Hot mix 在运行 <code>npm run fetch-hub-news</code> 时从公开 RSS 合并写入；去重为尽力而为，时间戳随 feed，标题多保留来源站英文。</p><p>最近核对：<strong>2026-05-19</strong>。盗版索引、破解与非官方 ROM 站点一律不收录。</p><p><strong>适合谁看：</strong>已经会逛几家商店官网，但想在一个横向列表里扫一遍<strong>第一方</strong>补丁、硬件与运营公告的人。我自己当「周日补课」用，不把它当成 APK 发现站。大版本更新我默认会先出现在 Steam 新闻或御三家博客里；纯手游 MMO 门户放在「更多」，好让前十行仍能和常见欧美营收表对照。</p>",
  "rankTitleEn": "Global top 10 (platforms)",
  "rankTitleZh": "全球前十（平台与发行）",
  "rankLeadEn": "Storefronts and publishers that Newzoo-style revenue tables usually put up front for PC and console — mobile-first giants are in “more”.",
  "rankLeadZh": "Newzoo 一类营收表里 PC/主机侧常见前排的商店与发行商；手游为主、官网形态差异大的巨头放在「更多」。",
  "newsTitleEn": "Latest updates",
  "newsTitleZh": "最新动态",
  "newsLeadEn": "Three official press or blog links per row — patch notes, hardware, and first-party releases straight from each vendor.",
  "newsLeadZh": "每行三条各厂商官网或博客的一手公告/更新链接（补丁、硬件、第一方发行等）。",
  "hotMixTitleEn": "Hot games & industry news (PC, console, mobile) — RSS",
  "hotMixTitleZh": "热门游戏与资讯（网游、主机、手游等 · 自动 RSS）",
  "hotMixLeadEn": "Merged from public RSS when you run npm run fetch-hub-news: Steam news, PlayStation & Xbox blogs, Epic/Unreal feed, and TechCrunch tags (gaming, Nintendo, Steam, esports, mobile games, etc.). Items sort newest-first by feed date; titles are often English.",
  "hotMixLeadZh": "运行 npm run fetch-hub-news 时合并：Steam 新闻、PlayStation / Xbox 官方博客、Epic/Unreal RSS，以及 TechCrunch 游戏、主机、电竞、手游等标签。条目按 feed 日期尽量新在前；标题多为英文。",
